# What Vercel does NOT need to upload.
#
# Nothing here is deleted from the repository; this file only keeps dead weight
# out of the deployment. Every entry was checked against the source first: none
# of these is imported by a component or referenced by `lib/media.ts`, and the
# four clips the site actually plays (hero-class, hero-class-mobile, mapping,
# pigment, all under public/brand) are deliberately NOT listed.
#
# Together these are about 23MB of the repository's 46.

# A stray camera original that was copied into the source tree. Nothing imports
# it, and a 10MB binary inside `src/` is traced by the bundler for no reason.
src/lib/*.MOV

# Two clips dropped in the project root during an early hand-off. Unused.
WhatsApp Video *.mp4

# A camera original in `public/` that no media object points at. Anything under
# `public/` is served verbatim, so an unreferenced 4.4MB file here is 4.4MB of
# upload and cache for a URL nobody requests.
public/06aa8692-35d7-4b5a-8475-4d9504116b39.MP4
